  "note": "The Base frames per slot, imported from item-base.md by tools/bases.ts --write. Weight is in the unit items show; primary and secondary are the Mod ids that frame may roll; defence is the type line 1 locks; school is the Gear Mod the frame carries; family is the off-hand family (Shield · Book) and null elsewhere. base_mod is the line-1 pool in the shape the roll reads: defence is the three armour Mods, drawn_line1_slots the slots whose line 1 draws from their own pool, weapons the forced Mods per type, off_hand the Shield / Book families. weapons and weapon_pools come from equipment-weapon.md and equipment-slot-weapon.md. weapon_frames is the A10 list per weapon type (from the Frames table in item-base.md), which the loot roll reads at step 2. tools/loot.ts and the client both read this file, and `node tools/bases.ts --checks` gates it against the docs so none of them can drift.",
